{"3209060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CLOWNOUT", "steam_appid": 3209060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLOWNOUT - Smash or Dash!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/c5e268c5131c8181635f649ae5c2d3bd.webp?t=1760290756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/c5e268c5131c8181635f649ae5c2d3bd.poster.webp?t=1760290756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clowns vs. humans. Rabbits vs. clowns. What could possibly be crazier?<br>Only <strong>this game of chase-tag, hammer-smashers, and pure chaotic fun</strong>.<br>Enough joking around - the clowns are done clowning. Now they’ve got <strong>sledgehammers</strong>, and they're aiming straight for the pranksters’ skulls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/9fdf4b3f2b8e6e7bf4c888bae48e1ea8.webp?t=1760290756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/9fdf4b3f2b8e6e7bf4c888bae48e1ea8.poster.webp?t=1760290756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the pranksters came prepared - <strong>cakes, traps, and brooms</strong>! Not for cleaning, of course, but for chaotic quidditch-style takedowns and mid-air madness.<br><strong>Tons of wild game modes</strong> await - for glory, for chaos, or just for the sheer joy of being ridiculous. <br>Join the madness. What are you waiting for? The clown is already on his way. 🚨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/d4b50dff787985c95a77f18b787aa3b8.webp?t=1760290756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/d4b50dff787985c95a77f18b787aa3b8.poster.webp?t=1760290756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules? Simple as 2+2 (unless you're a clown):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clowns get <strong>60 seconds</strong> to catch a human with their hammer - or they're out. <br>Catch someone? Swap roles. Now you're the clown.<br>The fun doesn’t stop until one player is left standing… or sobbing in laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that’s just the beginning.<br>Carry logs to build a raft. <br>Steal candy from clowns. <br>Enter DeathMatch. <br>Die creatively in under 60 seconds. <br>And yes - that might count as a win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/135384818efa2cb0e5abd40a17432a8c.webp?t=1760290756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/135384818efa2cb0e5abd40a17432a8c.poster.webp?t=1760290756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play across <strong>10 unique maps</strong> packed with traps, secrets, and delightful insanity:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a raft and escape</strong> - before the clowns close in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and devour 16 candies… without exploding</strong> - too sweet to survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eliminate as many pranksters or clowns as possible</strong> - the hunt begins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die in 60 seconds</strong> - and do it with style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and many other chaotic modes no serious game would dare include.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and did we mention the <strong>giant clown</strong> who drops in to “restore order” on the map?<br>Yeah. That’s a thing. He’s huge. He’s angry. And he’s got opinions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/bf85a71c91be7c6c268ab4d9e2892393.webp?t=1760290756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/bf85a71c91be7c6c268ab4d9e2892393.poster.webp?t=1760290756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>6 players</strong> in online mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 handcrafted maps</strong> full of secrets, hazards, and humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes</strong>: from classic catch-and-swap to pure nonsense carnage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane abilities</strong>: traps, teleportation, disguise as random objects, balloon flight, broomsticks - yes, actual broomsticks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world where chaos is an art form</strong>, and laughter is your only escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/0e70ab22edb91571323c052595e71e45.webp?t=1760290756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/0e70ab22edb91571323c052595e71e45.poster.webp?t=1760290756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLOWNOUT</strong> isn’t just a game.<br>It’s a <strong>multiplayer madhouse</strong> where you either laugh, or get hammered (literally).<br>Choose your side - or just start the riot.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLOWNOUT - Smash or Dash!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/c5e268c5131c8181635f649ae5c2d3bd.webp?t=1760290756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/c5e268c5131c8181635f649ae5c2d3bd.poster.webp?t=1760290756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clowns vs. humans. Rabbits vs. clowns. What could possibly be crazier?<br>Only <strong>this game of chase-tag, hammer-smashers, and pure chaotic fun</strong>.<br>Enough joking around - the clowns are done clowning. Now they’ve got <strong>sledgehammers</strong>, and they're aiming straight for the pranksters’ skulls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/9fdf4b3f2b8e6e7bf4c888bae48e1ea8.webp?t=1760290756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/9fdf4b3f2b8e6e7bf4c888bae48e1ea8.poster.webp?t=1760290756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the pranksters came prepared - <strong>cakes, traps, and brooms</strong>! Not for cleaning, of course, but for chaotic quidditch-style takedowns and mid-air madness.<br><strong>Tons of wild game modes</strong> await - for glory, for chaos, or just for the sheer joy of being ridiculous. <br>Join the madness. What are you waiting for? The clown is already on his way. 🚨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/d4b50dff787985c95a77f18b787aa3b8.webp?t=1760290756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/d4b50dff787985c95a77f18b787aa3b8.poster.webp?t=1760290756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules? Simple as 2+2 (unless you're a clown):</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clowns get <strong>60 seconds</strong> to catch a human with their hammer - or they're out. <br>Catch someone? Swap roles. Now you're the clown.<br>The fun doesn’t stop until one player is left standing… or sobbing in laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that’s just the beginning.<br>Carry logs to build a raft. <br>Steal candy from clowns. <br>Enter DeathMatch. <br>Die creatively in under 60 seconds. <br>And yes - that might count as a win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/135384818efa2cb0e5abd40a17432a8c.webp?t=1760290756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/extras/135384818efa2cb0e5abd40a17432a8c.poster.webp?t=1760290756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=353 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play across <strong>10 unique maps</strong> packed with traps, secrets, and delightful insanity:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a raft and escape</strong> - before the clowns close in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and devour 16 candies… without exploding</strong> - too sweet to survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eliminate as many pranksters or clowns as possible</strong> - the hunt begins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die in 60 seconds</strong> - and do it with style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and many other chaotic modes no serious game would dare include.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and did we mention the <strong>giant clown</strong> who drops in to “restore order” on the map?<br>Yeah. That’s a thing. He’s huge. He’s angry. And he’s got opinions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra