, and broomstick flight. Chaos, comedy, and total madness await!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/2a2a7de6fcd94fab7459857415da8784213f35da/header.jpg?t=1760290756", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/e212a9f1dabc9aba7ff51040e71823c6edd9bac3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760290756", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209060/e212a9f1dabc9aba7ff51040e71823c6edd9bac3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760290756", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> MS Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 10th gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> MS Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 10th gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3060ti<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["PlayGenix"], "publishers": ["PlayGenix"],